# 📖 About

This directory contains the complete source code for the **Smart Electronic Voting Machine (EVM)**. The program is developed using **Embedded C** in the **Arduino IDE** and controls every core function of the system.

The code is written in a modular and readable manner to make future enhancements and maintenance easier.

---

# 🚀 Core Functionalities

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| 🔐 Fingerprint Authentication | Verifies the identity of each voter |
| 🎤 Voice Assistance | Guides the voter throughout the voting process |
| 📺 LCD Display | Displays instructions and voting status |
| 🗳️ Vote Recording | Securely records the selected vote |
| 🔒 Duplicate Vote Protection | Prevents the same voter from voting twice |
| 🔔 Buzzer Notification | Provides audio confirmation for user actions |
| 📊 Result Generation | Displays the final voting results |

